# Job Applicants Analyzer

Multi-tenant hiring tool on **TanStack Start + Supabase**. Legacy Next.js + FastAPI stack archived in `old-app/`.

## Stack

| Layer | Path | Tech |
|-------|------|------|
| Full-stack app | `src/` | TanStack Start, React 19, Tailwind 4 |
| Server logic | `src/server/` | TypeScript server functions |
| Database | Supabase Postgres | Drizzle ORM (`src/db/`) |
| Local PII (migration source) | `data/candidates/` | Filesystem (gitignored) |
| Auth & storage | `supabase/` | Supabase Auth + RLS + Storage |
| Config | `config/` | `job-criteria.yaml`, email templates |
| Legacy stack | `old-app/` | Next.js 16 + FastAPI (archived) |
| Docs | `docs/` | Architecture, migration roadmap |

## Dev commands

```bash
bun install && bun run dev          # :3000
bun run migrate:local               # data/ → Supabase
bun run build                       # production build
```

Legacy local stack: `cd old-app && npm run dev` (see `old-app/README.md`).

